# Used only by `npm run build:android` (vite --mode capacitor). The Capacitor Android WebView is
# not served from app.joinnorthstack.com like the web app is, so relative "/api/..." calls (the
# production default in src/api/http.ts) would resolve against the WebView's own origin instead.
# This is a public URL, not a secret — safe to commit.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://app.joinnorthstack.com
